adopts ard, role directories can move to a shared roles repo pinned by ref, like a sidecar; a repo's own directory of the same name wins. `after` names triage roles, with no self-reference and no cycles.\n416-","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VwheTvM83whmvupM3y13wu","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
